th A\u2019s exceptional technical foresight but serious organizational and attitude deficits.\n**Remaining uncertainty**: How severe C\u2019s communication difficulties are in practice for long\u2011haul crew coordination, and whether his reluctance to pursue further education will impact long\u2011term performance.\n**What would change my vote**:\n- Concrete evidence that another candidate (especially A) has comparable reliability and calmness *and* demonstrably strong communication/teamwork without the organizational or attitude flaws noted.\n- Evidence that C\u2019s communication problems lead to critical misunderstand\u2011understandings or safety\u2011relevant errors.\nOverall, I judge C to best balance the required safety, decision\u2011making, teamwork, and long\u2011term suitability, pending clarification of his communication impact.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
