9s strong hazard\u2011anticipation and leadership but serious organizational and interpersonal deficits.\n**Remaining uncertainty**: How much C\u2019s communication difficulties will actually affect crew coordination and safety\u2011critical exchanges (e.g., with ATC), and whether his reluctance to pursue further education will limit future performance.\n**What would change my vote**: Concrete evidence that another candidate matches C\u2019s reliability and calmness while demonstrably possessing stronger communication/teamwork skills and a clear commitment to professional development, or evidence that C\u2019s communication problems lead to critical misunderstandings in flight operations.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
