ut lacks hazard\u2011anticipation ability and has communication deficits. B and D have more pronounced attitude and teamwork issues.\n**Remaining uncertainty**: How severe A\u2019s disorganization and unfriendly demeanor are in practice for long\u2011haul operations, and whether they would lead to procedural lapses or crew friction. Likewise, the practical impact of C\u2019s communication difficulties on crew/ATC coordination.\n**What would change my vote**: Concrete evidence that A\u2019s organizational or interpersonal issues have caused safety\u2011relevant errors, or evidence that C\u2019s communication problems are minor and that C also possesses comparable hazard\u2011anticipation abilities.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate A\"}"}
