teamwork/organizational weaknesses. The other candidates exhibit even greater attitude or teamwork deficits.\n**Remaining uncertainty:** How much C\u2019s communication difficulties will actually impair crew or ATC interactions in practice, and whether his reluctance to further education will limit long\u2011term development. Conversely, the practical severity of A\u2019s disorganization and unfriendly behavior for long\u2011haul procedural compliance remains unclear.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that C\u2019s communication problems lead to safety\u2011critical misunderstandings, or that A\u2019s organizational/attitudinal issues have caused procedural errors; or evidence that another candidate matches C\u2019s reliability and calmness while demonstrating stronger communication and a clear commitment to professional growth.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
